    "lyrics": {
      "text": "O_ all-ho--ly__ The-o-to---kos,__ do thou___ not a--ban-don__ me__ for as__ long___ as___ I__ live; do thou___ not___ en-trust___ me to an-y hu--man pro-tec-----tion, but do__ thou__ thy-self de--fend___ and__ have mer-cy__ on___ me.__\n\nUn-to thee do__ I__ com-mit mine___ eve-ry__ hope,__ O Moth----er of__ God; guard me un---der thy___ shel-----ter.____"
